# regress.sh keeps each fixture's full output here.
.regress/
# regress.sh holds this while it runs (one run at a time).
.regress.lock/

# Claude Code runtime state, not a workspace file.
workspace/.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock

# Real credentials for the legacy site. Never commit.
.env.legacy
# The AI provider's real keys, loaded by the api (F14). Never commit.
.env.ai
# The fixture suite is tracked (D-1057); its run output, screenshots and the sheet key's real drawings are not.
fx-suite/.regress/
fx-suite/.regress.lock
fx-suite/sheet-key/
fx-suite/**/node_modules/
fx-suite/**/shots/
fx-suite/**/*.pdf
browser/.qt-run.*

# Founder reference workbooks with job figures (2026-11-06): never in the mirror or a commit.
workspace/docs/reference/Mohave_AZ_all_crafts_labor_comparison.xlsx
workspace/docs/reference/DE MAIN SOURCE FILE*
# Bid tabs and client inputs under docs/reference (D-1372, standing): on disk only, never in git or the mirror. The
# mirror refresh skips them (an "Only in ../docs/reference: Bid tabs ..." diff is expected, not a gap).
workspace/docs/reference/Bid tabs*
workspace/docs/reference/**/*[Bb]id tab*
workspace/docs/reference/**/*[Bb]id-tab*
workspace/docs/reference/**/*[Cc]lient input*
# Spreadsheets and office files under docs/reference (D-1387, the founder's D-1384 Q4, standing): on disk only, never
# in git or the mirror (CSV is text and stays: the names scan reads it). `./workspace-mirror.sh` skips every root file
# whose mirror path this file ignores and prints the skips as expected "Only in" lines. Any case (the [Xx] classes).
workspace/docs/reference/**/*.[Xx][Ll][Ss]
workspace/docs/reference/**/*.[Xx][Ll][Ss][XxMmBb]
workspace/docs/reference/**/*.[Oo][Dd][SsTtPp]
workspace/docs/reference/**/*.[Dd][Oo][Cc]
workspace/docs/reference/**/*.[Dd][Oo][Cc][Xx]
workspace/docs/reference/**/*.[Pp][Pp][Tt]
workspace/docs/reference/**/*.[Pp][Pp][Tt][Xx]

# Morning reports, their zips and logs stay on disk, out of git (2026-11-13). Ignoring does not untrack what is already
# tracked (morning-report-2026-10-30 to -11-09): that stays as it is until the founder decides.
morning-report-*/
morning-report-*.zip
morning-report-*/**/*.log
# A named company's crew-costing workbook (its wage, burden and equipment rates): on disk, never in git (D-1259).
workspace/docs/reference/Crew_Assemley_DE_LLC*
# The fx suite's copy of the guard (D-1276, D-1272 7): its ids moved to E:\Intelcost\.private\ (D-1228). `fx-suite.sh setup`
# copies browser/lib/protected.mjs here, which reads the guard list from INTELCOST_GUARD_LIST and fails closed.
fx-suite/browser/lib/protected.mjs
